.TH shbar 1 "2026-11-18" "shbar 1.0" "terminal status, header and divider bar"
.SH NAME
shbar \- a divider and status or header bar for the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shbar
.RB [ \-bh ]
.RB [ \-c
.IR char ]
.RB [ \-p
.IR text ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shbar
is a small C program that can be used as a visual divider, header, or bottom bar.
It always fills to the end of the terminal's width.
.PP
There are some minimal options to customize it.
.PP
.B shbar
is part of the
.I shui\-tools
collection.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-b
Turn on reverse video for
.B \-p
.IR text .
.TP
.BI \-c " char"
Use a different filler character.
The default is an underscore
.RB ( _ ).
A space character
.RB ( \(dq\ \(dq )
is also possible.
.TP
.B \-h
Show a short usage message.
.TP
.BI \-p " text"
Display
.I text
as a prompt.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
status="[ load 3% : t/sec 49 : source.c ] "
shbar \-p "${status}"

shbar \-bp "Result as follows: " \-c " "
cat result.txt | less \-r +G
.EE
.SH BUGS
Probably.
